---
---

<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 font-sans">
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-10">
    <div class="w-48 h-48 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-300">
      <img src="/img/eu.png" alt="Osmar Mazinho" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1 text-left">
      <h1 class="text-4xl text-center md:text-left font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        Da lógica na sala de aula à <span class="text-blue-600">Engenharia de Software.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        Comecei lecionando no Ensino Fundamental em 2002, onde já ensinava lógica para as crianças. Desde então, minha trajetória tem sido decodificar problemas e estruturar soluções escaláveis. Sou um polímata por natureza: <strong>professor, administrador, músico, motociclista e desenvolvedor.</strong> Hoje consolido essa vivência à frente da <strong>OMSOFTWARE ॐ</strong> como CEO e Engenheiro de Software.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
    <p>
      Atualmente, foco na intersecção entre arquitetura de software, automação de processos e eficiência operacional. Como <strong>CEO da OMSOFTWARE ॐ</strong> e mestrando em <strong>Gestão 4.0</strong>, desenvolvo integrações com inteligência e ferramentas no-code/code que geram impacto mensurável para negócios e serviços.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex justify-end gap-3 mt-4">
    <!-- Botão Cartão de Visitas Virtual -->
    <a
      href="https://mazinhorj.github.io/vcard/" 
      target="_blank"
      class="p-2 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400"
      title="Cartão de Visitas Virtual (VCard)"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-6 h-6"
        fill="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      >
        <path
          d="M20 4H4c-1.11 0-1.99.89-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.11.89 2 2 2h16c1.11 0 2-.89 2-2V6c0-1.11-.89-2-2-2zm0 14H4V6h16v12zM6 10h2v2H6zm0 4h8v-2H6zm10 0h2v-2h-2zm-6-4h8V8h-8z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </a>

    <!-- GitHub -->
    <a
      href="https://github.com/mazinhorj"
      target="_blank"
      class="p-2 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors"
      title="GitHub"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300"
        fill="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      >
        <path
          d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </a>

    <!-- LinkedIn -->
    <a
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mazinhorj/"
      target="_blank"
      class="p-2 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors"
      title="LinkedIn"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600"
        fill="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      >
        <path
          d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 backdrop-blur-sm">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">Graduação</h3>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Engenharia de Software</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">100%</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded-full h-4 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-blue-600 h-full rounded-full shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(37,99,235,0.4)] transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 100%"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm mt-4 text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-medium italic">2026 • UNOPAR/Anhanguera</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 backdrop-blur-sm">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">Mestrado</h3>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Gestão 4.0 na Educação</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-2xl font-mono font-black text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">45%</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 dark:bg-slate-700 rounded-full h-4 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-purple-600 h-full rounded-full shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(147,51,234,0.4)] transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 45%"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm mt-4 text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-medium italic">Defesa prevista: Julho/2027 🏍️</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>